me Employment Calvary University Job Board Public Job Board This job board is a service to our community. The jobs posted here and organizations they represent may or may not be in agreement with Calvary’s mission, purpose, values, or doctrinal stance. Quick Links Post a Job Manage your Job Postings Keywords Location Remote positions only Category Any category Calvary University Faculty Staff Public Job Listings Freelance Full Time Internship Part Time Temporary Your browser does not support JavaScript, or it is disabled. JavaScript must be enabled in order to view listings. Load more listings Explore Programs: Associate’s Bachelor's/Undergraduate Master’s/Graduate Doctoral/PhD Seminary Certificates Microcredentials Prospective Students: Academic Departments & Majors Financial Aid & Tuition Admissions About Calvary Campus Life Early College Campus Resources: Library Campus Security Box Office Facility Reservation Campus Map Current Students: IT & Help Desk myCU Portal Academic Calendar Student Handbook Payment Options Clark Academic Center Employment Contact Us: 15800 Calvary Road Kansas City, MO 64147 Information: (816) 322-0110 Admissions: (816) 322-3960 Visit Us Apply Now Request Information ©2026 Calvary University Consumer Information Privacy Policy HEERF Reports"
